  1463	        """Best-effort sync read of user text for build-kind audit classification.
  1464	
  1465	        Loop composition is synchronous, so use the same SQLite recovery pattern as
  1466	        _surface_of. Non-SQLite test stores simply get the CUSTOM fallback.
