Implemented REL-3 audit mode, no commit and no server restart.

Summary:
- Added `DISCO_TOOLSCOPE_AUDIT` flag, default off.
- Added observe-only `ContractScopeGuard` mode using the existing guard decision path.
- Default build-like runs now get audit-only contract/phase tracking when flag is on, with kind classification and tightened CUSTOM fallback.
- Logs one `toolscope audit would-deny` line per would-deny and a terminal summary with total tools plus denies by phase.
- Added REL-3 audit tests; adjusted two selected legacy tests so the requested broad gate no longer hangs on unrelated TestClient/async-test issues.

